    "tldr": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "TL;DR: A remote analyst req now gates on Microsoft Fabric, not just Power BI; Kolkata's mid-rung BI req wants ETL tooling beside the BI stack; and 2026 role bands put the BI Developer at ₹8–15L while the analytics engineer climbs to ₹12–22L.",
        "variant": "lead"
      }
    },
    "sep1": {
      "type": "Separator",
      "props": {
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    "i1title": {
      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
        "text": "1. Sutherland — Data Analyst (Remote, India), posted today",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    "i1meta": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "3–7 yrs, \"minimum 2 years hands-on Microsoft Fabric or Azure analytics.\" Fabric Data Factory, Lakehouse/Warehouse, Delta Tables, star/snowflake schemas, SQL, Python (Pandas/NumPy/PySpark), Power BI; DP-600/DP-700 preferred. Comp not stated.",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "i1why": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Why it matters: remote + Fabric-first is the clearest read yet that medallion/Delta engineering, not dashboards, is the gate.",
        "variant": "muted"
      }
    },
    "i1link": {
      "type": "Link",
      "props": {
        "label": "talanto.work/jobs/15c7341d-59d7-44dc-9e1b-e57d62e5916f",
        "href": "https://talanto.work/jobs/15c7341d-59d7-44dc-9e1b-e57d62e5916f"
      }
    },
    "sep2": {
      "type": "Separator",
      "props": {
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    "i2title": {
      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
        "text": "2. Genpact — Analyst, BI/Reporting & Data Viz 5B (Kolkata), posted 29–30 Sep",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    "i2meta": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "2–5 yrs; Informatica PowerCenter, Matillion ETL, Python, SQL, VBA, Excel, Power BI, Tableau, Oracle/SAP. Comp not stated.",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "i2why": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Why it matters: even a mid-rung BI req now expects ETL tooling alongside the BI stack — report-only profiles are the gap.",
        "variant": "muted"
      }
    },
    "i2link": {
      "type": "Link",
      "props": {
        "label": "jobaaj.com/job/genpact-analyst-bi-reporting-and-data-visualization-5b-...-kolkata-wb-2-to-5-years-1826288",
        "href": "https://www.jobaaj.com/job/genpact-analyst-bi-reporting-and-data-visualization-5b-1401-g-india-godrej-genesis-17-flr-kolkata-wb-2-to-5-years-1826288"
      }
    },
    "sep3": {
      "type": "Separator",
      "props": {
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    "i3title": {
      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
        "text": "3. Comp reality: the ₹15L line is a role split, not a seniority ladder",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    "i3meta": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "2026 India bands: BI Developer ₹8–15L (plateauing) vs Analytics Engineer ₹12–22L and Data Engineer ₹14–28L; SQL+Python+cloud ₹8–30L vs Power BI+SQL ₹6–20L. A services firm pays a 3–5 yr analyst ₹7–12L where a product firm pays ₹15–28L for a comparable profile.",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
